---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const cases = await getCollection('cases');
const policy = cases.find(item => item.data.slug === 'policy-analyst-strategic-review');
---
<section class="selected-evidence section-y theme-grey" id="evidence">
  <span id="case" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="project" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="method" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-top meta"><p>02 / Selected evidence</p><a href="/work/">All work &amp; research ↗</a></div>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Observe before<br />prescribing.</h2>
    <div class="proof-pair">
      {policy && <article>
        <p class="meta">Case account / Policy analysis</p>
        <h3><a href={'/cases/' + policy.data.slug}>{policy.data.title}</a></h3>
        <p>A strategic report had stalled. The work returned to the argument it needed to make.</p>
        <p class="proof-result"><span>Reported outcome</span>{policy.data.result}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={'/cases/' + policy.data.slug}>Read the case account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>}
      <article>
        <p class="meta">Behavioural research / South Africa</p>
        <h3><a href="/work/#research">Cookstove adoption.</a></h3>
        <p>Investigating motivations and everyday cooking practices alongside the technology itself.</p>
        <p class="proof-finding">The pilot reported increased LPG and biomass stove ownership, but no significant reduction in paraffin stove ownership.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/work/#research">Examine the research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .proof-pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-sm); margin-top: var(--space-sm); }
  article { border-top: 1px solid #aaa; padding-top: 28px; }
  h3 { max-width: 20ch; margin-top: 32px; font-size: var(--heading-4); line-height: 1.08; }
  h3 a { text-decoration: none; }
  h3 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--signal); }
  article > p:not(.meta) { max-width: 45ch; margin-top: 24px; font-size: var(--body); line-height: 1.5; }
  article .proof-result { font-size: var(--body-large); font-weight: 600; }
  .proof-result span { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font: 11px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 400; }
  .proof-finding { color: #626262; }
  .text-link { margin-top: 28px; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .proof-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; } h3 { font-size: 32px; } article > p:not(.meta) { font-size: 18px; } }
</style>
